<title>USA: U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review -- June 6.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review -- June 6.</headline>
<text>
<p>National Sunflower Summary -- USDA Market News Service</p>
<p>Prices as of June 6, 1997</p>
<p>Weekly Trends: Sunflower Seeds were mostly 20 to 40 cents lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Meal was steady to 5.00 lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Oil was 25 to 40 points lower.</p>
